WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:06.480
<v Deniz Arslan>Okay, I think everyone's here. Quick one today, mostly the launch date.</v>

2
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.300
<v Deniz Arslan>Burak, where are we with the checkout page?</v>

3
00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:21.600
<v Burak Şen>It works on desktop. On phones the address form still jumps when the keyboard opens, and I haven't found why. I'd say two more days, maybe three if it's the payment widget.</v>

4
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.000
<v Deniz Arslan>Is three days a problem for marketing?</v>

5
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:38.200
<v Elif Kaya>A bit. The newsletter goes out on Thursday and it links straight to the shop. If checkout is broken on phones that's most of our readers. Can we hold the link and send it the week after?</v>

6
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:41.000
<v Burak Şen>That would take the pressure off, yes.</v>

7
00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:52.300
<v Deniz Arslan>Fine. Newsletter goes out without the shop link, Elif adds it to the next one. Burak, can you post an update on Wednesday either way?</v>

8
00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.100
<v Burak Şen>Sure.</v>

9
00:00:54.600 --> 00:01:02.900
<v Elif Kaya>One more thing, do we have the product photos in the new size? The old ones look blurry on the new layout.</v>

10
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:08.000
<v Deniz Arslan>I'll ask the studio today. Anything else? No? Thanks, everyone.</v>
